  "description": "Cross-process synchronization for Compze.Threading. A system-mutex-backed IAwaitableMutex that offers the full Monitor.Wait condition-wait model across process boundaries, plus IProcessShared/IAwaitableProcessShared and the file-based InterprocessSignal. Extracted from Compze.Threading 0.7.0-alpha.",
